@host = https://localhost:7043
@deviceId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@apiCredential = replace-with-monitoring-read-credential
@antiforgery = replace-with-session-token
@version = replace-with-retention-version
@confirmationToken = replace-with-preview-confirmation-token

### Metric sources from raw and retained five-minute history.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/host-metrics/series?from=2026-01-01T00%3A00%3A00Z&until=2027-01-01T00%3A00%3A00Z&kind=CpuTotalPercent&page=0
Authorization: Bearer {{apiCredential}}

### The following operations require an Administrator browser session.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/settings/host-metrics/retention

### Preview the effect of shortening retention.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/settings/host-metrics/retention/preview
RequestVerificationToken: {{antiforgery}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rawDays": 10, "rollupDays": 60, "version": "{{version}}" }

### Apply the confirmed settings.
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/settings/host-metrics/retention
RequestVerificationToken: {{antiforgery}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rawDays": 10, "rollupDays": 60, "version": "{{version}}", "confirmationToken": "{{confirmationToken}}" }

### Read changes made to host metric retention.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/operations/audit/host-metric-retention?from=2026-11-01T00%3A00%3A00Z&to=2026-11-02T00%3A00%3A00Z
